        94466841
      ],
      "verdict": "HOLD. Coconut provisioning is real in two observer descriptions, but most relevant feeding frames are soft, distant or flash-washed. The best portrait 658753882 lacks the coconut. The draft depends on an imagined unknown preparer, and provisioned cutting should not become an asserted tooth-made hole. Keep attempted prose private; no food source or wild-foraging claim laundered from bait."
    },
